Court automation fee-amendments. 25LSO-0286, 1.0
FISCAL NOTE
FY 2026 FY 2027 FY 2028
NON-ADMINISTRATIVE IMPACT
Anticipated Revenue increase
SPECIAL REVENUE FUND $840,825 $849,235 $849,235
Source of revenue increase:
The source of the revenue increase is a $10 increase to the judicial systems
automation (JSA) fee assessed on citations, criminal cases, and filing fees in
the Judicial Branch.
Assumptions:
The estimates above assume the number of transactions in which the JSA fee is
assessed will increase by 1% each biennium.
